00:00:10.380 --> 00:00:12.467
And I work on the
Chrome Browser team,

00:00:12.467 --> 00:00:13.800
as a Chrome browser specialists.

00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:15.293
I'm here with my
associate, Nick.

00:00:15.293 --> 00:00:16.710
Nick, give yourself
a quick intro.

00:00:16.710 --> 00:00:17.300
NICK PETERSON: Hi, everyone.

00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:17.800
I'm Nick.

00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:20.778
I work on Google security
in the IT department.

00:00:20.778 --> 00:00:22.320
FLETCHER OLIVER:
Great, so what we're

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:25.320
going to be covering
today in this session--

00:00:25.320 --> 00:00:29.490
is we've gotten a lot of
feedback from our customers

00:00:29.490 --> 00:00:32.549
that managing
extensions at scale

00:00:32.549 --> 00:00:36.086
can tend to be a
painful process.

00:00:36.086 --> 00:00:38.670
It can be a little cumbersome.

00:00:38.670 --> 00:00:40.320
And we hear you.

00:00:40.320 --> 00:00:43.110
And obviously, there's
people in the seats today.

00:00:43.110 --> 00:00:46.313
So most likely, you
